    <h2>What Is the Dairy Queen Ultimate Hash Browns Platter?</h2>
    <p>For morning diners seeking the ultimate comfort food skillet, the Ultimate Hash Browns Platter is the heavyweight champion of Dairy Queen's breakfast menu. Starting with a golden, crisp-seared bed of seasoned shredded hash browns, this hearty platter is piled high with savory pork breakfast sausage crumbles, fluffy scrambled eggs, and melted shredded cheddar cheese, all smothered under a generous ladle of warm, black-peppered Southern country gravy.</p>
    <p>Rather than serving breakfast components separately across multiple side dishes, the Ultimate Platter fuses every savory element into a single, cohesive forkful. The crunch of the pan-browned potato crust holds up admirably beneath the velvety richness of the country gravy and eggs, delivering a diner-quality breakfast experience at a fast-food drive-thru window.</p>

    <h2>2026 Pricing, Calories &amp; Nutritional Facts</h2>
    <p>Priced at an exceptional value of <strong>$5.99</strong>, the Ultimate Hash Browns Platter provides a high-protein, calorie-dense breakfast built for long, demanding mornings:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Calories:</strong> 790 cal</li>
      <li><strong>Protein:</strong> 28g of energizing protein from whole eggs, pork sausage, and real cheddar</li>
      <li><strong>Total Fat:</strong> 52g (19g Saturated Fat)</li>
      <li><strong>Carbohydrates:</strong> 54g from crispy shredded russet potatoes</li>
      <li><strong>Sodium:</strong> ~1,840 mg</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>DQ Breakfast Platter Showdown (2026 Comparison)</h2>
    <p>Dairy Queen's morning menu spans hearty skillets, classic sit-down platters, and quick handheld wraps:</p>
    <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Breakfast Option</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Style &amp; Key Ingredients</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><strong>Ultimate Hash Browns Platter</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$5.99</td><td>790</td><td>All-in-one potato skillet: hash browns, sausage, eggs, cheese, country gravy</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Country Breakfast Platter</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$6.99</td><td>~1,000</td><td>Traditional spread: eggs, choice of bacon/sausage, hash browns, warm buttermilk biscuit</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Buttermilk Pancake Platter</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$5.49</td><td>680</td><td>Sweet breakfast: stack of fluffy pancakes, butter, syrup, and breakfast sausage</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Loaded Breakfast Burrito</strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.49</td><td>~350</td><td>Handheld portability: scrambled eggs, sausage, cheese, wrapped in a warm tortilla</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

    <h2>Breakfast Hours &amp; Critical Regional Availability</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Regional Availability:</strong> Unlike Blizzards and soft serve cones which are sold at every DQ worldwide, breakfast service is strictly franchised and offered primarily at select full "Grill &amp; Chill" locations throughout the Midwest, Texas, and Southern states. Always check your local store before traveling.</li>
      <li><strong>Morning Hours:</strong> Participating locations typically serve breakfast from 6:00 AM or 6:30 AM until 10:30 AM daily (sometimes extending until 11:00 AM on Sundays).</li>
      <li><strong>Add Hot Fresh Coffee:</strong> Pair your platter with DQ's freshly brewed hot coffee ($1.69) or an ice-cold carton of 2% milk for a classic morning start.</li>
    </ul>

